  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the App Structure**\n\nI\'m now focused on the single-screen application for \"Track 01: Civic & Governance.\" The VoiceReporter component is key, designed for either simulated or real audio recording via web audio. It will incorporate features like recording and saving functionality. I\'m also now considering adding a transcript option for the VoiceReporter output.\n\n\n**Defining the Backend Architecture**\n\nI\'m now integrating an Express server into the Vite React app. The plan includes using the Gemini API server-side for audio and image processing, focusing on dynamic voice mode, verification, and JSON generation. I will mock Firestore or use local state for the hackathon MVP, unless Firebase setup is explicitly requested, I\'ll leverage the standard Express backend in the AI Studio environment. I\'m updating `package.json` to include `tsx`.\n\n\n"
