    thinking: "**Designing Input Methods**\n\nI\'m working on expanding the input methods for the UI. I\'m focusing on integrating a text box, photo upload/capture functionality, and retaining the existing voice mode. The goal is a step-by-step interactive voice agent that flexibly accepts text, photos, and voice, all seamlessly integrated. I\'m currently modifying the `VoiceReporter.tsx` file for the multi-modal UI modifications.\n\n\n**Refining Interface Flow**\n\nI\'ve decided to prioritize a simplified multi-step form over a tabbed interface. The user needs a clear path: Describe, Photo (optional), Submit. I\'m leaning toward combining these into one form, perhaps updating `VoiceReporter.tsx` to handle text input, photo uploads, and voice recording through a single interface, giving users flexibility. Specifically, I\'m refactoring `VoiceReporter.tsx` to include a text area, a file input triggered by a button, and a voice record button.\n\n\n"
