    thinking: "**Designing the User Interface**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the UI elements for the `VoiceReporter.tsx` component. I\'m planning to implement a comprehensive form with a text area for descriptions, a file input for image uploads, a voice recording button, and a submission button. I\'m exploring interactive form designs for a step-by-step or consolidated approach.\n\n\n**Refining the Submission Flow**\n\nI\'ve shifted gears. Instead of a consolidated form, I\'m leaning toward a simple, interactive wizard approach for the `VoiceReporter.tsx` component. The idea is to guide users through a step-by-step process. Step 1 will involve either a text box for typing or a voice recording option to describe the issue. Step 2 will focus on image capture or upload, and then we\'ll proceed to the final processing step.\n\n\n"
