    thinking: "**Prioritizing Feature Implementation**\n\nI\'m currently focused on prioritizing the feature list. Integrating voice conversations via the Live API is at the top, given the low-latency requirement. Google Maps data is next, leveraging Maps Grounding. Finally, I\'ll integrate Gemini\'s intelligence with varied models.\n\n\n**Refining Gemini Model Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating Gemini models. I\'m focusing on incorporating `gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview` for real-time voice conversations via the Live API. Next, I\'ll leverage `gemini-3.5-flash` with the `googleSearch` tool in our `process-civic-report` API route for location verification and nearby landmark identification. Finally, I\'ll explore high-level thinking with `gemini-3.1-pro-preview`. I\'m starting by transcribing audio using `gemini-3.5-flash` and responding using `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 13561848
