  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have integrated the comprehensive suite of Gemini capabilities into the Civic Engine application to handle a wide range of analytical and interactive tasks:\n\n- **Live Multimodal Conversations**: Added the **Live Civic Assistant** in the voice reporter. It establishes a WebSocket connection to the server, streaming real-time audio to and from the `gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview` model, enabling users to speak directly with an AI operator.\n- **Maps Grounding**: Enabled the `googleMaps` tool in the primary civic report intake engine. When processing incoming reports, `gemini-3.5-flash` will now verify locations and landmarks using live Google Maps data.\n- **Strategic High-Thinking**: Implemented an **AI Strategic Analysis** module on the Authority Dashboard. Clicking the \"AI Strategic Analysis\" button triggers the `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` model with `ThinkingLevel.HIGH` to synthesize complex resolution strategies across all reported issues.\n- **Low-Latency Categorization**: Deployed an optimized backend `/api/quick-categorize` endpoint that leverages `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` to instantly triage simple text issues into explicit functional categories.\n- **Audio Transcription Engine**: Added a dedicated `/api/transcribe` endpoint utilizing `gemini-3.5-flash` to extract precise original-language transcriptions from raw audio recordings prior to multimodal processing."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
