g WebSocket communication, specifically handling audio data transmission and interruption signals from the server. I\'m focusing on how `serverContent?.modelTurn?.parts[0]?.inlineData?.data` is processed and sent as audio, ensuring data integrity. I\'m also ensuring the \"interrupted\" signal is correctly transmitted, using `clientWs.readyState === 1` for consistent messaging. My attention is also on the `submit_report` tool within the callback, logging the extracted issue and preparing for report creation.\n\n\n"
