    thinking: "**Confirming Build Success**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the build has succeeded, which is excellent. I\'ve successfully implemented the `CitizenDashboard`. It now showcases a Leaflet map, pinpointing the user\'s current location directly. I\'ve also incorporated visual cues for nearby civic issues.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the requested tracking, ranking, and voting features, integrating a robust map-centric interface for the user dashboard.\n\n- **Citizen Dashboard & Geolocation Sync:** On login, the application automatically requests the user\342\200\231s exact coordinates and renders a live, interactive map powered by Leaflet. This pins down their location and immediately curates a real-time cluster map of active civic issues near them, avoiding random reporting noise.\n- **Priority Upvote Mechanism:** Instead of creating redundant duplicate reports, citizens can select existing issues on the map and cast a validation vote via the \"Upvote\" button. This dynamically updates the backend `priority_score` scaling formula immediately.\n- **Live Assistant Agent Functionality:** I have deployed full guardrails, context instructions, and tool schemas to the Gemini Live operator. The conversational AI can now intelligently gather categorical parameters (Severity, Location, Summaries) and securely execute a `submit_report` payload back to the local database seamlessly in real-time, displaying a success state on the screen as it concludes the call."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 303757283
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
