he `useEffect` hook to asynchronously attempt to obtain the user\'s location, with a short timeout. The Authority Dashboard\'s map renders instantly too, as it\'s pre-configured to render at the same location.\n\n\n**Adding Manual Mode**\n\nI\'m now integrating the \"Quick Post (Manual)\" mode into `VoiceReporter.tsx`. I\'ve added a \'manual\' option to the `mode` state and will update the mode selector buttons accordingly. I\'m considering the button\'s appearance and behavior to ensure a smooth user experience.\n\n\n"
