ntegrating upvote/downvote colors. I\'ve successfully implemented conditional classes in the project render loop. The button colors dynamically reflect the user\'s vote status, using `voted_users` for the server data. The goal is to provide visual feedback, so I\'m trying to improve the experience, ensuring the styling is clear and intuitive.\n\n\n"
